     <td><para unique="1261833">AVX512DQ</para>
      <para unique="1261834">OR AVX10.1</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261231">Move 8 bits mask from k2/m8 and store the result in k1. </para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261233">VEX.L0.0F.W1 90 /r </para>
